# The art, as references. The pixels live in PNGs beside this file and the
# engine decodes them itself -- idml is a layout language and does not
# describe images (ARCHITECTURE.md 7.6).
#
# Migrated from the character-grid form this file used to carry; the images
# are pixel-for-pixel what those characters said.

sprite bird from "art/bird.png" grid (1, 3) cell (17, 12)
sprite pipe-cap from "art/pipe-cap.png" grid (1, 1) cell (52, 26)
sprite pipe-shaft from "art/pipe-shaft.png" grid (1, 1) cell (52, 8)
sprite ground from "art/ground.png" grid (1, 1) cell (24, 12)
font digits from "art/digits.png" grid (1, 10) cell (4, 6) first 48
